<title>USA: Boyd offers four mln common shrs at $9/shr.</title>
<headline>Boyd offers four mln common shrs at $9/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boyd Gaming Corp said Tuesday that it is offering 4,000,000 shares of common stock at $9.00 per share, all to be sold by Boyd.</p>
<p>The company also said it is concurrently offering $200 million of 9.25 percent senior unsecured notes due 2003 at a price of 99.597 to yield 9.33 percent.</p>
<p>The company said it has granted underwriters an option to buy up to 600,000 more shares of common stock for over-allotments.</p>
</text>
